SCR-DTI release notice
======================

This repository contains the paper-facing SCR-DTI implementation. It does not
bundle trained model weights, benchmark datasets, Hugging Face model snapshots,
or private cluster artifacts.

The projection-network topology used for the pretrained molecular/protein
representations follows the public GRAM-DTI implementation described as MIT
licensed by its authors. SCR-DTI reimplements only the small projector topology
needed by the paper-facing model; the GRAM-DTI repository itself is not vendored.

The optional representation-precomputation command refers to the public model
identifiers ibm-research/MoLFormer-XL-both-10pct, laituan245/molt5-base, and
facebook/esm2_t33_650M_UR50D. Those model artifacts are not redistributed here
and remain subject to their respective upstream licenses and terms.

Benchmark data are not redistributed. In particular, users are responsible for
complying with DrugBank and other source-specific data licenses.

